{"id": "legacy__train-042", "group_id": "material_ff687b46965d", "text": "この辺にモンスターはおる？", "context": [], "label": "enemy_information", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["presence"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "「この辺」「モンスター」「おる」の短い自然な存在質問を代表として残す。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-042"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-044", "group_id": "material_ff687b46965d", "text": "いま敵が見えてる？", "context": [], "label": "enemy_information", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["presence"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "敵が存在するかと、いま見えているかの区別を持つ短い代表例。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-044"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-045", "group_id": "material_ff687b46965d", "text": "背後にクリーパーはいそう？", "context": [], "label": "enemy_information", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["presence"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "背後という相対方向と「いそう？」の推量を含む存在照会を残す。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-045"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-101", "group_id": "material_aefbb08bd4ce", "text": "斧じゃなくて剣にして。", "context": [], "label": "equip_sword", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["correction", "negation"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "否定する対象が斧で、求める操作が剣である代表。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-101"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-105", "group_id": "material_aefbb08bd4ce", "text": "馬を呼ばなくていい、今は剣を装備して。", "context": [], "label": "equip_sword", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["correction", "negation"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "馬の呼び戻しを否定して剣の装備を依頼する、操作間の対照を残す。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-105"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-107", "group_id": "material_aefbb08bd4ce", "text": "木の剣じゃなくて鉄の剣を持って。", "context": [], "label": "equip_sword", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["correction", "negation"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "剣そのものを否定するのでなく、木から鉄へ対象を絞る訂正例。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-107"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-151", "group_id": "material_2fea79c7cea4", "text": "剣は替えなくていいから、馬を呼んで。", "context": [], "label": "recall_mount", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["correction", "negation"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "剣は替えなくてよいが馬は呼んでほしいという操作間の対照。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-151"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-152", "group_id": "material_2fea79c7cea4", "text": "ロバじゃなくてラバを呼び戻して。", "context": [], "label": "recall_mount", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["correction", "negation"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "ロバを否定しラバを指定し直す例を残す。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-152"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-156", "group_id": "material_2fea79c7cea4", "text": "新しい馬は出さなくていい。僕の馬を呼んで。", "context": [], "label": "recall_mount", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["correction", "negation"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "新しい馬を出すことを否定し、本人の馬を呼ぶという対象の違いを残す。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-156"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-160", "group_id": "material_2fea79c7cea4", "text": "さっきは不要って言ったけど、今はラマを呼び戻して。", "context": [], "label": "recall_mount", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["correction", "negation"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "さっきの不要を取り消し、今はラマを呼び戻す現在意図を残す。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-160"]}
{"id": "legacy__train-576", "group_id": "material_812d0f07ebf7", "text": "敵が出てくる前に備えたいから、今、剣に持ち替えて。", "context": [], "label": "equip_sword", "needs_clarification": false, "tags": ["context", "direct"], "source": "synthetic", "rationale": "敵が出る前という理由でも実行時点は明示的に「今」である例を残す。条件が成立したら実行する依頼との境界。", "source_keys": ["legacy:train-576"]}
